      "chunk_text": "Rohan Deshmukh called insurance agent Sunita Agarwal to check the activation status of his home insurance policy after paying the premium. Sunita explained that the policy is currently pending review of his fire-safety certificate by the underwriting team, which can take up to 24 hours. She agreed to flag the review as urgent. Additionally, Sunita promised to email the policy terms and PDF within 10 minutes and provided instructions on how to file a claim using the 24/7 hotline.",
